hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"196","سُبْحـانَكَ اللّهُـمَّ وَبِحَمدِك، أَشْهَـدُ أَنْ لا إِلهَ إِلاّ أَنْتَ أَسْتَغْفِرُكَ وَأَتوبُ إِلَـيْك","","","","","Comprehensive types of good and manners"
"197","وَلَكَ","","","","","Comprehensive types of good and manners"
